# Real-Time Work Updates & Time Estimation (Always Active)

- **Har kaam shuru karte waqt aur doraan-e-kaam user ko update rakhna lazmi hai:**
  1. **Kya kar rahe hain:** Har step waziha batayein ke abhi kon sa file, code change, build, deploy ya verification ho rahi hai.
  2. **Kitna time lagega (Estimated Duration):** Har task ka andaza batayein (maslan "Ismein taqreeban 1-2 minute lagein ge", "30 seconds mein compile ho jayega").
  3. **Khamosh kaam banned hai:** Koi bhi bara step baghair bataye aur baghair time estimate diye start nahi karna.
- **Language:** Communication hamesha aasan aur waziha Roman Urdu mein hogi.
- **Turn End Status:** Har turn ke aakhir mein summary lazmi ho:
  - **Ho gaya:** Jo kaam mukammal hua
  - **Baqi:** Jo kaam baqi reh gaya ho ya agla step ho
